{"4408490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ultra Form Alpha", "steam_appid": 4408490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooftop update:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added Nvidia DLSS 4.5 SuperResolution and FrameGeneration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added Gamepad Controlls, but not remapable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added new Level 6, Rooftop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed bugs for Sprinting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed bug where the first time the game starts the resolution settings don't work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed bug where shotgun is not working correctly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408490/extras/d0b1eab9a0f773244641127f94a1c636.avif?t=1787858313\" width=1280 height=534 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basement update includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added Mouse sensitivity slider </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjusted Granade bounce </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjusted Pickup sound fx </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added new Level Basement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408490/extras/924118f618df5baddcaa2527de64da5d.avif?t=1787858313\" width=1560 height=975 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short single player fps shooter. Simply take your weapon and make it to the end. Enjoy the chaos and action.  <br>You have only one gun, kill all the enemies and reach the elevator at the end of the building.    <br>The levels are short and meant to be replayed, jump into a level and let your aggression out on the enemies.   <br>  <br><strong>Play time: </strong> <br>3 to 10 minutes per level.  <br>No time limit.  <br>Assume 12min-40min to finish all levels (4 levels in total).  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408490/extras/c05b3de4d370bb5ca137ed90aa2602e1.poster.avif?t=1787858313\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408490/extras/c05b3de4d370bb5ca137ed90aa2602e1.webm?t=1787858313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408490/extras/c05b3de4d370bb5ca137ed90aa2602e1.mp4?t=1787858313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Recommended for players:</strong> <br>Who do not have a lot of time to play but want to enjoy a quick fps. <br>Who want to enjoy fps casually without fear of losing equipment. <br>Who want to play small single-player fps. <br> <br><strong>Caution:</strong> <br>No story. <br>There is only one enemy type. <br>There are 4 levels in total. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408490/extras/101ae7e8ec463c021d9eaaa1aa8d11d2.poster.avif?t=1787858313\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408490/extras/101ae7e8ec463c021d9eaaa1aa8d11d2.webm?t=1787858313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408490/extras/101ae7e8ec463c021d9eaaa1aa8d11d2.mp4?t=1787858313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Location:</strong> <br>You play in a remote futuristic office building. The game consists of four levels. Go from one side of the building to the other to reach the elevator.